WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.603
-We should talk about
coronavirus, if you don't mind.

00:00:03.603 --> 00:00:06.539
I just don't know as a --
You know, I watch the news.

00:00:06.539 --> 00:00:08.208
I read the news.

00:00:08.208 --> 00:00:10.776
And I just don't know
who to really trust.

00:00:10.776 --> 00:00:12.178
I'm hearing --

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:14.647
-That is the problem
that we have today.

00:00:14.647 --> 00:00:17.617
We have a president
who is anti-science,

00:00:17.617 --> 00:00:19.952
doesn't believe in the reality
of climate change,

00:00:19.952 --> 00:00:22.221
who has appointed Mike Pence,

00:00:22.221 --> 00:00:25.224
who is also not known
to be much of a scientist...

00:00:25.224 --> 00:00:28.527
[ Laughter ]
...to lead the task force.

00:00:28.527 --> 00:00:31.998
And, clearly, at this moment,
you need somebody you can trust

00:00:31.998 --> 00:00:34.734
who is going to bring together
the best scientists, doctors,

00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:37.870
researchers,
work with the entire world

00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:43.342
to do everything that we can
to halt this terrible pandemic.

00:00:43.342 --> 00:00:45.545
And I think, clearly,

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:47.781
there are some things
we have to do right away.

00:00:47.781 --> 00:00:50.449
The idea that we have so many
of our people in this country --

00:00:50.449 --> 00:00:52.585
the only country on Earth,
major country,

00:00:52.585 --> 00:00:54.520
that doesn't guarantee
healthcare to all people --

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:57.824
we have to make sure
that everybody right now

00:00:57.824 --> 00:01:01.293
feels free when you're sick
to go to a doctor

00:01:01.293 --> 00:01:03.028
regardless of your income.

00:01:03.028 --> 00:01:05.631
And you know what? The
government will pay that bill.

00:01:05.631 --> 00:01:08.668
Number two, we are
the only major country on Earth

00:01:08.668 --> 00:01:12.672
not to guarantee
paid medical leave.

00:01:12.672 --> 00:01:16.309
So, if you can believe it, there
are people who are sick today

00:01:16.309 --> 00:01:20.880
who may actually believe they
have symptoms of the coronavirus

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:22.715
who are going to work
because they have no income.

00:01:22.715 --> 00:01:24.550
They're making
12, 13 bucks an hour.

00:01:24.550 --> 00:01:26.852
They got to feed their families.
They go to work.

00:01:26.852 --> 00:01:29.989
We have got to do what every
other country on Earth does

00:01:29.989 --> 00:01:33.193
and guarantee
paid family and medical leave

00:01:33.193 --> 00:01:36.028
and do it right now
on an emergency basis.

00:01:36.028 --> 00:01:38.097
There was a discussion
recently --

00:01:38.097 --> 00:01:40.232
There's a lot of work
being done globally

00:01:40.232 --> 00:01:41.867
in terms of a vaccine.

00:01:41.867 --> 00:01:43.869
And the Trump administration
was saying,

00:01:43.869 --> 00:01:46.906
"Well, we can't guarantee
that it will be affordable.

00:01:46.906 --> 00:01:48.641
Got to worry about
the drug companies."

00:01:48.641 --> 00:01:51.077
Well, that is a crock.
That is ridiculous.

00:01:51.077 --> 00:01:54.213
We have got to make sure that
when that vaccine comes out,

00:01:54.213 --> 00:01:56.549
it is available to everybody
in this country

00:01:56.549 --> 00:01:58.351
regardless of their income.

00:01:58.351 --> 00:02:00.320
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:07.193
-Mike Pence
being in charge of this

00:02:07.193 --> 00:02:09.228
is very interesting
to a lot of people

00:02:09.228 --> 00:02:11.497
because they think
that he's going to be --

00:02:11.497 --> 00:02:13.132
take the fall from this,
take the hit,

00:02:13.132 --> 00:02:15.235
because this is a disaster,
I think.

00:02:15.235 --> 00:02:17.770
And then they're going to say
that Trump is going to have

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:20.239
Nikki Haley on the ticket
in 2020.

00:02:20.239 --> 00:02:22.475
What are you hearing
over in your...?

00:02:22.475 --> 00:02:24.877
-Well, you know, it's ultimately

00:02:24.877 --> 00:02:27.279
the President of the
United States' responsibility.

00:02:27.279 --> 00:02:31.483
And why you would appoint
a Vice President to lead this

00:02:31.483 --> 00:02:34.052
whose own particular record
with regard to science,

00:02:34.052 --> 00:02:37.823
with regard to the HIV virus,
has been pretty pathetic.

00:02:37.823 --> 00:02:39.758
What you need to do
to give confidence

00:02:39.758 --> 00:02:43.996
to the American people is bring
the best minds in the country,

00:02:43.996 --> 00:02:45.465
in the world together.

00:02:45.465 --> 00:02:48.200
As a leader,
that's what you can be doing.

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:50.470
And don't make this
into politics.

00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:52.404
Don't start attacking Democrats.

00:02:52.404 --> 00:02:54.307
That is not only absurd,

00:02:54.307 --> 00:02:56.875
it is demoralizing
for the American people.

00:02:56.875 --> 00:02:59.011
-Last time we talked,

00:02:59.011 --> 00:03:01.247
your face lit up
when I mentioned your grandkids.

00:03:01.247 --> 00:03:03.416
-Yeah.
-How many grandkids do you have?

00:03:03.416 --> 00:03:05.818
-I have seven
very beautiful grandchildren.

00:03:05.818 --> 00:03:07.887
-How old -- Uh...

00:03:07.887 --> 00:03:09.455
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:09.455 --> 00:03:12.091
How old is the oldest grandkid?
Like, 60? 63?

00:03:12.091 --> 00:03:15.160
[ Laughter ]

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:16.695
-Close.
-Thank you very much.

00:03:16.695 --> 00:03:18.197
-She's 16, I think.
-Oh, 16.

00:03:18.197 --> 00:03:20.366
So she knows
what's going on in the world

00:03:20.366 --> 00:03:22.468
and knows the issues
and what the president does.

00:03:22.468 --> 00:03:24.136
-Yeah.
-And she probably has opinions.

00:03:24.136 --> 00:03:25.771
She can't vote,
but she has opinions.

00:03:25.771 --> 00:03:27.707
-Yeah, we drag them out
to a whole lot of rallies.

00:03:27.707 --> 00:03:30.442
-Yeah. What do they want?
What's their concern?

00:03:30.442 --> 00:03:33.111
And what is the future
for our grandkids?

00:03:33.111 --> 00:03:34.680
-I think, you know --

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:36.749
And one of the reasons
that I'm running for President

00:03:36.749 --> 00:03:38.351
is for my grandchildren

00:03:38.351 --> 00:03:41.054
and for kids all over this
country and all over the world.

00:03:41.054 --> 00:03:42.955
And, you know,
as the richest country

00:03:42.955 --> 00:03:44.790
in the history of the world,
Jimmy,

00:03:44.790 --> 00:03:46.626
you don't hear this much
on television,

00:03:46.626 --> 00:03:49.195
but there should not be
a half a million people

00:03:49.195 --> 00:03:51.497
sleeping out on the streets
of America tonight.

00:03:51.497 --> 00:03:54.934
Half of our people should not
live paycheck to paycheck.

00:03:54.934 --> 00:03:59.272
87 million should not lack
the health care that they need.

00:03:59.272 --> 00:04:02.775
All of our kids
deserve quality education

00:04:02.775 --> 00:04:05.611
regardless of the ZIP code
that you live in.

00:04:05.611 --> 00:04:10.016
We should lead the world
in combating climate change.

00:04:10.016 --> 00:04:13.786
We got to end the racist and
broken criminal justice system

00:04:13.786 --> 00:04:18.490
and a completely discombobulated
immigration system

00:04:18.490 --> 00:04:20.359
where people
are terrorized today,

00:04:20.359 --> 00:04:22.061
they're going to be
picked up by ICE.

00:04:22.061 --> 00:04:24.464
There is so much to be done
in this country,

00:04:24.464 --> 00:04:26.365
and we're the richest country
in the history of the world,

00:04:26.365 --> 00:04:28.968
but we got to deal with
this greed that's out there.

00:04:28.968 --> 00:04:31.504
It's not acceptable
that three people

00:04:31.504 --> 00:04:33.873
own more wealth
than the bottom half of America.

00:04:33.873 --> 00:04:35.408
It's not acceptable

00:04:35.408 --> 00:04:38.644
that the top 1% owns more wealth
than the bottom 92%.

00:04:38.644 --> 00:04:41.413
Look, no one has a problem
with people being rich,

00:04:41.413 --> 00:04:44.716
but we have got to address
not only this incredible

00:04:44.716 --> 00:04:47.820
and unfair distribution
of income and wealth.

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:49.422
It's also power.

00:04:49.422 --> 00:04:50.923
It is billionaires

00:04:50.923 --> 00:04:53.225
exerting unbelievable
political influence.

00:04:53.225 --> 00:04:55.227
They buy and sell politicians.

00:04:55.227 --> 00:04:57.764
They make huge
campaign contributions.

00:04:57.764 --> 00:05:01.366
If we honestly believe
that we are a democracy,

00:05:01.366 --> 00:05:04.603
we got to end billionaire rule
in this country

00:05:04.603 --> 00:05:06.272
and create an economy
and a government

00:05:06.272 --> 00:05:08.474
that works for all of us.
That's what we got to do.

00:05:08.474 --> 00:05:11.310
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Senator Bernie Sanders.

00:05:11.310 --> 00:05:14.380
Senator Bernie Sanders, thank
you so much for being here.

